{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Hand percussion kit based on the AVL Drumkits Buskman's Holiday: cajon, congas, shakers, tambourines, claves, cymbal, cowbell, foot stomp, bucket and bell tree, 21 pieces (notes 35-55, stick click on 35), 210 samples with ten velocity layers (stereo bell trees), clickable kit photo, stereo output, ported from avldrums.lv2 by Robin Gareus (fluidsynth sample engine, kit photo and hit map) https://github.com/x42/avldrums.lv2 (GPLv2+) Samples and kit photo: AVL Drumkits (Buskman's Holiday) by Glen MacArthur, http://www.bandshed.net/avldrumkits/ Samples as modified for avldrums.lv2, then reduced to 12-bit and joined into one file for this plugin; the sample file remains under CC-BY-SA 3.0 (see Dependencies/Drumkits/BuskStop-LICENSE.txt), and music made with it can be licensed freely JSFX code released under GPLv3+ license Claude Opus 5.x may have generated some of the port of this code\par}
}

