{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Juno-style chorus with modes I, I+II and II, tone and mix controls, ported from junologue-chorus by Peter Allwin https://github.com/peterall/junologue-chorus (MIT) JSFX version released under MIT license Claude Opus 5.x may have generated some of the port of this code\par}
