{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Acoustic drum kit based on the AVL Drumkits Red Zeppelin 4-piece, 26 pieces on the GM drum map (notes 36-61), 118 samples with five velocity layers, hi-hat and cymbal chokes, clickable kit photo, stereo or multi-channel (kick, snare, hi-hat, tom, floor tom, overheads, percussion) outputs, ported from avldrums.lv2 by Robin Gareus (fluidsynth sample engine, kit photo and hit map) https://github.com/x42/avldrums.lv2 (GPLv2+) Samples and kit photo: AVL Drumkits (Red Zeppelin) by Glen MacArthur, http://www.bandshed.net/avldrumkits/ Samples as modified for avldrums.lv2, then reduced to 12-bit and joined into one file for this plugin; the sample file remains under CC-BY-SA 3.0 (see Dependencies/Drumkits/LedHead-LICENSE.txt), and music made with it can be licensed freely JSFX code released under GPLv3+ license Claude Opus 5.x may have generated some of the port of this code\par}
}

