{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 A macro oscillator in the style of Mutable Instruments Plaits: 24 synthesis models in three banks, from virtual analog, wavefolding, FM, grains, additive, wavetables, chords and speech to swarms, noise, particles, physical models of strings and resonators and analog-style drums, plus the newer bank with a filtered VA voice, phase distortion, three banks of six-operator FM patches, wave terrain, a string machine and a chiptune voice. Harmonics, Timbre and Morph shape the sound; MIDI notes play it through the module's low-pass gate (pinged like the TRIG input, or gated with velocity like the LEVEL input), or it can drone. Needs Dependencies/PlaitTectonics/plaits_tables.txt. Ported from Plaits by Emilie Gillet (Mutable Instruments) https://github.com/pichenettes/eurorack (MIT) JSFX version released under GPLv3+ license Claude generated some of this code\par}
}

