{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 A resonator in the style of Mutable Instruments Rings: a bank of tuned modes, sympathetic strings, a Karplus-Strong string with dispersion and an FM voice, each excited by an internal pluck/strike or by whatever audio you feed it. Play it from MIDI (each note strums the next voice; chords strum 10 ms apart, as on the module) or use it as an effect on a track: in Audio Only mode the input excites the resonator and its transients strum it, with the pitch set by the Frequency knob. Disastrous Peace is the module's hidden string synth with formant, chorus, reverb and ensemble. Pitch bend is +/- 2 semitones. Ported from Rings by Emilie Gillet (Mutable Instruments) https://github.com/pichenettes/eurorack (MIT) JSFX version released under GPLv3+ license Claude generated some of this code\par}
}

