{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Four instruments in one: ePiano, JX10 (analog-style synth), DX10 (two-operator FM) and Piano, ported from mda-lv2 by Paul Kellett (Maxim Digital Audio) and David Robillard https://gitlab.com/drobilla/mda-lv2 (GPLv3+) JSFX version released under GPLv3+ license Claude Opus 5.x may have generated some of the port of this code\par}
